# Agent worktrees are scratch checkouts, never part of the repository.
.claude/worktrees/

# Raw board generations (assets/<Slug>.png, ~14MB each).
#
# The nine original boards are tracked and stay tracked — gitignore does not
# untrack. New ones are not: eighteen more worlds at fourteen megabytes each
# would push this repo past half a gigabyte, and what actually ships is
# public/scenes/<slug>/base.webp. To re-derive the web assets from a raw file
# you still have locally: generate-world.ts <slug> --from-asset
assets/*.png
!assets/random-girl*.png
!assets/noa-face.beach-original.png
